# theme: the desktop's look, docs/WORKBENCH.md section 5. A role, and what it
# is: a colour is one of sys/libpal's names or six hex digits, a metric a
# number. A role named nowhere keeps the chassis value, so this file states
# the chassis. $home/lib/theme is read after it, and the later line wins.
ground      slate_deep      # the desktop, and a window's well
face        magnesium       # a raised control's face
face.lit    magnesium_lit   # its top-left highlight
face.shade  magnesium_dark  # its bottom-right shadow
text        amber           # labels
bevel       2               # the depth of a raised edge
well        2               # the depth of a sunken one
pad         4               # a group's inset
gap         4               # between children
